#: plugin_search.cpp:184
msgid ""
"Comma separated list of file types to search in. example: \"*.cpp,*.h\"\n"
"NOTE: Put a minus sign ('-') in front of the list to make it into an exclude "
"list. example: \"-*.o,*.obj\""
msgstr ""
"En mit Kommas scheedt List vun Dateitypen, binnen de söökt warrt. Bispill: "
"\"*.cpp,*.h\"\n"
"Henwies: Warrt de List en Minusteken (\"-\") vöranstellt, lett se sik as "
"Utsluutlist bruken. Bispill: \"-*.o,*.obj\""

